{"stage": "vuln_analysis", "event": "candidate_ranked", "target": "192.168.56.104", "ts": "2026-08-09T01:35:59.184067+00:00", "port": 631, "service": "ipp", "confidence": 0.55, "risk": "high", "rationale": "배너가 CUPS 1.1.x로 명시되어 있어 HPGL 버퍼오버플로우(CVE-2004-1267), Negative Length HTTP Header(CVE-2002-1368), UDP DoS(CVE-2004-0558), Request Method DoS(CVE-2003-0195), GET DoS(edb 1196) 등 1.1.x 전용 취약점들이 버전상 부합하며 시도해볼 만하다. 반대로 2.0.3 이전 RCE(edb 41233)나 로컬 권한상승(7550)은 버전/환경이 맞지 않아 통할 가능성이 낮다. 다만 이 후보들 다수가 DoS/버퍼오버플로우류라 실행 시 cupsd 데몬이 크래시되거나 서비스가 완전히 죽을 위험이 매우 높다.", "searchsploit_matches": [{"title": "CUPS 1.1.x - '.HPGL' File Processor Buffer Overflow", "edb_id": "24977", "type": "remote", "codes": "CVE-2004-1267;OSVDB-12439", "path": "/usr/share/exploitdb/exploits/linux/remote/24977.txt"}, {"title": "CUPS 1.1.x - Cupsd Request Method Denial of Service", "edb_id": "22619", "type": "dos", "codes": "CVE-2003-0195;OSVDB-4780", "path": "/usr/share/exploitdb/exploits/linux/dos/22619.txt"}, {"title": "CUPS 1.1.x - Negative Length HTTP Header", "edb_id": "22106", "type": "remote", "codes": "CVE-2002-1368;OSVDB-10741", "path": "/usr/share/exploitdb/exploits/linux/remote/22106.txt"}, {"title": "CUPS 1.1.x - UDP Packet Remote Denial of Service", "edb_id": "24599", "type": "dos", "codes": "CVE-2004-0558;OSVDB-9995", "path": "/usr/share/exploitdb/exploits/linux/dos/24599.txt"}, {"title": "CUPS < 1.3.8-4 - Local Privilege Escalation", "edb_id": "7550", "type": "local", "codes": "CVE-2008-5377;OSVDB-50637", "path": "/usr/share/exploitdb/exploits/multiple/local/7550.c"}, {"title": "CUPS < 2.0.3 - Multiple Vulnerabilities", "edb_id": "37336", "type": "remote", "codes": "CVE-2015-1158;OSVDB-123116", "path": "/usr/share/exploitdb/exploits/multiple/remote/37336.txt"}, {"title": "CUPS < 2.0.3 - Remote Command Execution", "edb_id": "41233", "type": "remote", "codes": "CVE-2015-1158", "path": "/usr/share/exploitdb/exploits/linux/remote/41233.py"}, {"title": "CUPS Server 1.1 - GET Denial of Service",